   capture                20.8615 +/- 1.1                         7328 1451   92
   elastic scattering     6.00559 +/- 0.1                         7328 1451   93
                                                                  7328 1451   94
  Resonance Integral     NNL/ORNL (b)                             7328 1451   95
   total                  947.918 +/- 38.8                        7328 1451   96
   capture                709.755  +/- 34.4                       7328 1451   97
   elastic scattering     238.162  +/- 4.5                        7328 1451   98
