The value of R' was found by taking the average of values from    7328 1451  100
[ref07], [ref08], [ref09]. This matched the value used in [ref02].7328 1451  101
                                                                  7328 1451  102
  R' = 7.86 +\- 0.24 fm                                           7328 1451  103
                                                                  7328 1451  104
It should be noted that the channel radius, a_c, used in the      7328 1451  105
SAMMY fitting was set equal to R'. This closely follows the       7328 1451  106
procedure outlined in [ref12].                                    7328 1451  107
                                                                  7328 1451  108
The scattering lengths were calculated using the RRR parameters.  7328 1451  109
The values are given in the following table                       7328 1451  110
                                                                  7328 1451  111
  Scattering Length      NNL/ORNL (fm)      NIST (fm)             7328 1451  112
   free coherent          6.90 +/- 0.05      ---                  7328 1451  113
   free incoherent       -0.29 +/- 0.05      ---                  7328 1451  114
   bound coherent         6.94 +/- 0.05      6.91 +/- 0.07        7328 1451  115
   bound incoherent      -0.29 +/- 0.05     -0.29 +/- 0.03        7328 1451  116
