The bound coherent and incoherent scattering lengths were         7328 1451  118
calculated by mutiplying the free coherent and incoherent         7328 1451  119
scattering length values by (A+1)/A. The NNL/ORNL values for      7328 1451  120
the bound coherent and incoherent scattering lengths agree        7328 1451  121
within uncertainty to those given by [ref13] and [ref14].         7328 1451  122
The estimated uncertainty on the scattering length values were    7328 1451  123
calculated using a Monte Carlo method.                            7328 1451  124
