 PARAMETERIZATIONS                                                7328 1451  360
                                                                  7328 1451  361
 Following models and parameters were used in the                 7328 1451  362
 current evaluation:                                              7328 1451  363
                                                                  7328 1451  364
                                                                  7328 1451  365
  Coupled Channels                                                7328 1451  366
  ================                                                7328 1451  367
 Coupled Channels Method was used for incident channel            7328 1451  368
 calculations using RIPL #610 OM potential with following         7328 1451  369
 modifications:                                                   7328 1451  370
 Volume real potential radius in 181Ta was scaled by  0.99        7328 1451  371
 Real volume potential depth in 181Ta was scaled by  1.02         7328 1451  372
 Volume potential diffuseness in 181Ta was scaled by  1.09        7328 1451  373
